We salivate.

260
00:19:27,679 --> 00:19:28,399
Oh, no.

261
00:19:28,599 --> 00:19:29,459
Not good.

262
00:19:29,919 --> 00:19:31,219
Not good at all.

263
00:19:47,219 --> 00:19:48,799
Hey, I found you.

264
00:19:50,379 --> 00:19:52,219
I'm so glad you're okay.

265
00:19:53,279 --> 00:19:55,119
I don't think it here, guys.

266
00:19:55,799 --> 00:19:56,279
Shh.

267
00:19:57,139 --> 00:19:59,579
So we check out another part of jungle, right?

268
00:20:00,059 --> 00:20:01,239
Yeah, you're right.

269
00:20:02,579 --> 00:20:03,019
Good.

270
00:20:03,119 --> 00:20:04,079
