277
00:20:19,639 --> 00:20:21,019
Oh, I did it!

278
00:20:21,019 --> 00:20:21,599
Huh?

279
00:20:21,599 --> 00:20:23,099
Oh, I did it!

280
00:20:23,099 --> 00:20:24,399
Right there.

281
00:20:24,759 --> 00:20:25,639
Icy reindeer.

282
00:20:26,299 --> 00:20:27,439
