Hide.

286
00:20:38,379 --> 00:20:39,099
Oh!

287
00:20:39,099 --> 00:20:39,579
Arf!

288
00:20:40,079 --> 00:20:40,599
Oh!

289
00:20:40,599 --> 00:20:40,839
Oh!

290
00:20:40,839 --> 00:20:42,339
You're kidding me!

291
00:20:42,339 --> 00:20:55,019
