301
00:21:34,639 --> 00:21:37,639
I totally knew you were gonna do that!

302
00:21:42,639 --> 00:21:43,639
Guard point!

303
00:21:52,639 --> 00:22:03,639
And they're right back to fighting again.

304
00:22:03,639 --> 00:22:04,639
Of course.

305
00:22:06,639 --> 00:22:08,639
I guess she must be the mother.

306
00:22:09,639 --> 00:22:10,639
Take care!

307
00:22:10,639 --> 00:22:13,639
And don't forget the promise you made!

308
00:22:14,639 --> 00:22:16,639
